    // Construct a .5: 3 runes block base 60 -> curse n/a. Use staff base 80 with high-ench? staff no ench.
    // Simplest fractional: single rune base 25, follow-up -15% = -3.75 => 25 - 3.75 + 2.5 first(10%)=+2.5
    //   = 25 + 2.5 - 3.75 = 23.75 + 5 = 28.75 -> 29 (rounded up)
    expect(quote({ yearsWithMHPCO: 0 }, [{ type: "rune" }], 1)).toBe(29);
